{"id": "16-356-2-4", "zh": "Khaja：表示颤动。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-356-5-6", "zh": "Khajati（颤动）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-356-7-8", "zh": "Ejā（动摇）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-356-9-21", "zh": "这里的“**ejā**”，是因为它缘于利养等而动摇、颤动，所以叫 ejā；这是强烈渴爱的名称。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-357-2-4", "zh": "Buja：表示金刚的声响。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-357-5-9", "zh": "有些学者说是“vajiranigghose”（表示金刚的轰鸣）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-357-10-11", "zh": "Bojati（发出声响）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-358-2-7", "zh": "Khija、kuji、guji：表示含糊不清的声音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-358-8-9", "zh": "Khijati（发出含糊的声音）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-358-10-11", "zh": "Kuñjati（发出低沉的声音）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-358-12-13", "zh": "Guñjati（嗡嗡作响）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-359-2-6", "zh": "Laja、lāja、tajja：表示斥责、威吓。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-359-7-8", "zh": "Lajati（斥责）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-359-9-10", "zh": "Lājati（斥责）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-359-11-12", "zh": "Tajjati（威吓、斥责）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-360-2-4", "zh": "Laji：也表示光耀。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-360-5-8", "zh": "这里的“ca”（也）字，兼顾“斥责”的意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-360-9-10", "zh": "Lañjati（光耀；斥责）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-360-11-13", "zh": "第三种是“阐明方法者”（nayalañjaka）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-360-14-18", "zh": "因为它阐明、显示经文的意义，所以叫 lañjaka（阐明者）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-361-2-5", "zh": "Jaja、jaji：表示战斗。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-361-6-8", "zh": "yuddha（战斗）就是交战。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-361-9-10", "zh": "Jajati（战斗）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-361-11-12", "zh": "Jañjati（战斗）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-362-2-4", "zh": "Tuja：表示伤害。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-362-5-6", "zh": "Tojati（伤害）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-363-2-5", "zh": "Tuji：也表示施力。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "16-363-6-8", "zh": "balana 就是施展力量的行为。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-363-9-12", "zh": "这里的“ca”（也）字，兼顾“伤害”的意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-363-13-14", "zh": "Tuñjati（伤害；施力）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-364-2-7", "zh": "Gaja、kuji、muji、gajja：都表示发出声音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-364-8-9", "zh": "Gajati（吼叫）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-364-10-11", "zh": "Kuñjati（发出声音）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-364-12-13", "zh": "Muñjati（发出声音）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-364-14-19", "zh": "大象吼叫，乌云轰鸣。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-364-20-27", "zh": "在那里，家中出生的奴仆站着，高声说着粗鲁的大话。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-364-28-30", "zh": "宝珠发出声响。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-364-31-33", "zh": "发出智慧的吼声。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-364-34-36", "zh": "能够吼叫。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-364-37-38", "zh": "Gajjitā（吼叫者）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-364-39-40", "zh": "Gajjitvā（吼叫之后）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-364-41-45", "zh": "这里的“**gajo**”就是大象。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-364-46-50", "zh": "因为大象有许多名称——", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-365-2-10", "zh": "hatthī、nāgo、gajo、dantī，kuñjaro、vāraṇo、karī；", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-366-2-8", "zh": "mātaṅgo、dvirado、saṭṭhihāyano、anekapo、ibho，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-367-2-10", "zh": "还有 thambho、rammo 和 dvipo；母象则叫 hatthinī、kareṇukā；", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-368-2-9", "zh": "幼象叫 hatthipoto、hatthicchāpo，也叫 bhiṅko 和 kalabho。", "confidence": 78}
